flowchart LR
    D[Delivery Skill] --> ED[Evidence: delivery/readiness]
    D --> VD[Validation: targeted/workflow-delivery]
    R[Fresh Review Skill] --> TB[Trusted base bundle]
    TB --> ER[Evidence: review/recheck]
    TB --> VR[Validation: workflow-review]
    C[Closeout Skill] --> EC[Evidence: closeout-readonly/recheck]
    C --> VC[Validation: workflow-closeout]
    ED --> S[Compact success digest]
    VD --> S
    ER --> S
    VR --> S
    EC --> S
    VC --> S
    X[partial / unknown / drift / fail] --> B[Bounded targeted expansion]
    W[push / GitHub write / dangerous Git / branch delete] --> A[Explicit approval boundary]
    M[Merge] --> H[Maintainer manual action]
